# "Whenever you lose life, discard that many cards. Then if you have no cards in hand, you lose the game." Bot1 casts the
# Grimoire on turn 1 (a hand of Island, Forest, Swamp, Plains, Mountain and Island). Bot2's first Lightning Bolt makes it
# discard three (Forest, Swamp, Island) and keep three, still in the game (the other way round in the sibling scenario). The
# second Bolt takes three more, exactly the hand: the last three cards are discarded, the hand is then empty, and Bot1
# loses the game to the Grimoire's effect, not to its life (14 is above zero).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Marina Vendrell's Grimoire
Island
Forest
Swamp
Plains
Mountain
Island
Island x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

